    "message": "Check independent service-point queues on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThese tests took the small replay fixture and hand-added a floor plan\nwith two service points per facility, without facility awareness. They\nnow use generated_scenario_with_split_queues, a new fixture that gives\ntoilet_01 and water_station_main of the shared generated Scenario a\nleft and a right service point, capacity 2 and a toilet worker (#88).\n\nWith twenty generated people, counts and history are filtered to the\nthree queued requests, and everyone else is kept from deciding during\nthe run. The pre-queue checkpoint test moves to\ntests/unit/domain/test_facility_queues.py.\n\nThe same queues at a station that serves one person at a time stop the\nrun on a state check (#118); that case is a strict xfail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
